    "wholeunit": "Mar 2025 611-sideC_179 (pano R6AMZ8pY0e5dGnNQpwhJdQ, from 10th St): light natural cedar board siding, grey shingle hips, pale trim; Feb 2018 Avenue E shows the same forms in weathered dark brown before refinishing. Wall colour follows the present-day photo."
